## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.0 (Meituan)
- **Short description:** Meituan's open-weight LongCat model, released 2026-06-30; opencode.ai usage data shows 479B tokens over 2 months, 56K unique users, #34 by tokens; 1M context window (per opencode.ai data/compare vs longcat-2.5-preview); text in / text out; open weights.
- **Provider / access:** Meituan; Hugging Face (implied by github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-2.0 repo); opencode.ai usage data.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-06-30; knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `longcat-2.0` (opencode.ai; benchlm compare), `meituan/longcat-2.0` (likely HF).
- **Context window:** 1M tokens (opencode.ai data/compare pages list 1M for both longcat-2.0 and longcat-2.5-preview). Unverified against public retrieval benchmarks.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out (text-only — NOT multimodal; native multimodal arrived with LongCat 2.5 Preview per lookonchain announcement); reasoning yes; tool calls yes (agent work).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** benchlm compare tables list $0.00/$0.00 (open-weight placeholder); actual hosted pricing not found.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed (parameter count, MoE/dense, training recipe not found in fetched sources).

